{"articleNo":"180493","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=180493&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2017-2학기 독서인증제 시행 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.09.18","hit":"3945","attachments":[{"name":"독서인증제 안내문(2017_학생)2학기.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=180493&attachNo=78613"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font color=\"#050099\" size=\"5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>2017-2학기 독서인증제 시행을 아래와 같이 알려드리오니, 많은 참여 바랍니다.</strong></span></span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. 참여방법 및 인증절차 </font></span></span></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 가. 참여방법 : 독서→독후감 제출(원스톱서비스)→지도교수 평가→독서인증→인증점수 누적</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 독후감 : 800자 이상</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나. 독서자료 : 독서인증제 코너(도서관301호 테마존)에 비치, 대출가능</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 참여기간 : 2017.9.1.~2018.1.20.</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ ‘RC생활의 이해’ 교과목을 수강하는 학생은 11.30.(목)까지 </font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 독서인증 신청 및 인증 완료해야 함(1건)→학점 부여 시 반영</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. 독서인증 평가 결과</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 가. 합격 : 독서인증</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나. 불합격 : 독후감 재 제출(3일후 재제출 가능)</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※&nbsp; 필요 시 '면담요청' 처리 후 평가 결과처리(합격/불합격) 가능하며, </font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 10일 내 면담 불응 시 불합격 처리 가능</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">4.독서인증제 참여자 혜택&nbsp; </font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 가. 독서인증제 우수참여자 시상</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학기당 독서인증 고득점자를 선발하여 시상</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 최우수, 우수자에게 총장상 수여 </font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 나. 금오인재상 인증제도 시행시 독서인증 점수 반영</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; 다. 독서관련 프로그램 운영 시 우선 지원</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">5. 독서인증제 안내 페이지 : </font><a href=\"http://library.kumoh.ac.kr/service/Static.ax?page=Service601\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#000000\">http://library.kumoh.ac.kr/service/Static.ax?page=Service601</font></a></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><font color=\"#000000\">6. 독서인증제 관련 문의 : 도서관 열람팀(연속간행물실, 054-478-7170)</font></font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\">&nbsp;</font></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"Gulim\"><font size=\"5\"><br><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp